5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,200
Lyra: Never! Got it!

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,500
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Structure, Narrow Ledge, urgent.

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,800
