9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,400
Loom of Oblivion: The void welcomes you.

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,700
Lyra: Hold tight, blueprint!

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Fragmented Memory-Labyrinth Entrance, tense.

12
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Lyra: Echo Shards! Fast!

13
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,600
Kael: Labyrinth. Tricky.

14
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,900
Echo Shard: You cannot hide.

15
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,200
Lyra: This way!

16
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,500
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of Half-Formed Memories, desperate.

17
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,800
Lyra: Dead end. Trapped.

18
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,100
Echo Shard: Surrender. Rest.

19
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,400
Kael: No escape. I remember.

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,700
Lyra: Not my end!

21
00:00:45,1000 --> 00:00:49,1000
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of Half-Formed Memories, Cornered, tense.

22
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,300
