Kael: It’s… fading.

24
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:53,900
Echo Shard: Pointless struggle.

25
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,200
Lyra: Forgive me. GO!

26
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,500
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth, Narrow Crevice, dread.

27
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:00,800
Lyra: Protective? How?

28
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,100
Kael: It believes… it saves.

29
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,400
Lyra: By devouring us?

30
