37
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:23,800
Lyra: Path dissolving! No!

38
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:26,100
Kael: Use a shard. Any shard.

39
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,400
Lyra: My childhood… garden?

40
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,700
Loom of Oblivion: Release it. Be free.

41
00:01:29,1000 --> 00:01:30,1000
Lyra: Goodbye, garden.

42
