Kael: Faster! They know!

45
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:40,200
Loom of Oblivion: Your hope is futile.

46
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,500
Lyra: Not futile! NEVER!

47
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,800
♪ at dusk, in Sanctuary Threshold, Central Pedestal, desperate.

48
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,100
Lyra: Blueprint… and Kael?

49
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,400
