54
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:01,900
Loom of Oblivion: You seek sanctuary. Your father's dream.

55
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,200
Kael: Lyra… they know.

56
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:04,500
Lyra: My father? How?

57
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,800
Loom of Oblivion: We know all your dreams. We are you.
